{"id":"3876","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/3876_main_cumulus-congestus-and-haze_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图像显示了一个浓积云的很好例子，具有清晰的轮廓、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">深色底部</span> 和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">明亮的阳光照射顶部</span> 。维苏威火山上空发展最完善的云，位于中心位置，垂直范围很大，上部有强烈的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">发展，呈花椰菜外观</span> 。在该地区有轻微但不稳定的北风气流，云层在山坡上迅速发展。在图像的左侧可以看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">一层雾霾</span> 。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stephen Burt","location":"意大利那不勒斯索伦托","latitude":"纬度: 40° 37' 52'' N","longitude":"经度: 14° 22' 60'' E","date":"26 May 2015 0926 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.9.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.9.3"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/3876_syn_cumulus-congestus-and-haze_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>在0000 UTC，意大利中部位于不稳定的北极流中，在那不勒斯附近有一个1 013 hPa的小型反气旋。黎明后反气旋抑制对流长达几个小时，之后积云迅速增长。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇冠版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/3876_upper_cumulus-congestus-and-haze_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>1200 UTC，意大利普拉提卡空军基地(Pratica di Mare)（WMO 16245）的探测显示出一种对白天气温不稳定的气流。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/3876_sat_cumulus-congestus-and-haze_clouds.jpeg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>在0900 UTC的气象卫星图像上，意大利中部呈斑状模式的云是积云，以应对白天气温上升。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© NEODAAS/邓迪大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}